Text=* Schematic File
Text=*
Text=* Syntax:
Text=* .MODEL <model name> [AKO:<reference model name>] <ModelType>
Text=* +([<parameter name>=<value>][LOT[/#][/GAUSS|/UNIFORM|/WCASE]=[<tol>[%]] |[-<low>%,<high>%]][DEV[/#][/GAUSS|/UNIFORM|/WCASE]=[<tol>[%]]...)
Text=* ModelType must be one of OPA,D,NPN,NMOS,NJF,PUL,SIN,TRN,CORE,GASFET,VSWITCH,ISWITCH,CAP,IND,RES,PNP,PMOS,PJF,DOUTPUT,DINPUT,UADC,UDAC,UGATE,UTGATE,UEFF,UGFF,UDLY,UPLD,UROM,URAM,UBGT,UIO,LPNP,NIGBT,I,V
Text=*
Text=*Examples:
Text=* .MODEL 2N2222A NPN(BF=150 IS=1E-14)
Text=* .model M1 NMOS(KP=2.5E-5 VTO=1.345 CGDO=14.67p CGBO=4.566p)
Text=* .MODEL DK D(IS=1E-18)
Text=* .model 2N2222A AKO:2N2222 NPN (BF=55 ISE=10F)
Text=* .Model BJT1 NPN (RE=12 LOT/1/GAUSS=30% DEV/2/UNIFORM=2%)
Text=*
Text=* A .cir file is typically found in the data directory
Text=*
Text=*** From file C:\MC12\library\DIODESINC_BJT.LIB
Text=.MODEL 2DD1766Q NPN (BF=201 BR=4.00 CJC=41.4P CJE=218P EG=1.12 IKF=2.97
Text=+ IKR=4.50 IS=6.65F ISE=13.0F MJC=0.300 MJE=0.500 NE=2.00 NF=1.00 NR=1.00
Text=+ RB=0.275 RC=27.5M RE=68.7M TF=538P TR=101N VAF=102 VAR=20.0 VJC=0.300
Text=+ VJE=1.10 XTB=1.5)
Text=*** From file C:\MC12\library\DIODESINC_BJT.LIB
Text=.MODEL 2DD2656 NPN (BF=550 BR=110 CJC=18E-12 CJE=97.7E-12 IKF=0.99 IKR=0.63
Text=+ IS=2.61E-13 ISC=2.25E-12 ISE=7.17E-14 MJC=0.371 NC=1.45 NE=1.4148 RB=0.093
Text=+ RC=0.083 RE=0.073 TF=0.78E-9 TR=9E-9 VAF=84 VAR=51 VJC=0.435)
Text=*** From file C:\MC12\library\UTILITY.LBR
Text=*** 1MHz Sinusoidal Source
Text=.MODEL 1MHZ SIN (A=10m F=400k)
Text=.MODEL 10MHZ SIN (A=1m F=20MEG)
Text=*** From file C:\MC12\library\DIODE.LIB
Text=.MODEL 1N456A D (BV=30 CJO=4.505P IS=29.054P M=385.099M N=1.425 RL=125.018MEG
Text=+ RS=910.713M TT=5U VJ=700M)
